cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use EyeDataHub in your research, please cite the software record and each dataset used."
title: "EyeDataHub: a command-line tool for finding and accessing ophthalmology datasets"
abstract: >
  EyeDataHub is a versioned, community-extensible, source-term- and
  access-aware command-line tool backed by a manually curated snapshot of 451
  ophthalmology data resources across 18 primary categories. It supports
  discovery, inspection, separate dataset and article citations, acquisition
  preflight, and transfer from supported official sources. It does not host or
  redistribute the indexed third-party datasets, accept agreements for users,
  provide legal advice, or establish scientific suitability.
type: software
